<title>LATVIA: Most yields of Latvian T-bill sale rise.</title>
<headline>Most yields of Latvian T-bill sale rise.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields rose in all maturities except six-month paper at an auction of Latvian Treasury bills on Thursday, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All issues were sold out, the ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>Amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p> MATURITY   AVG YLD (pct)    AVG LAST WEEK  ISSUE  BID  SOLD</p>
<p> One month     9.55		9.46	    1.25  2.42  1.25</p>
<p> Three month  10.01		9.97	    1.5   2.56  1.5</p>
<p> Six month    10.41		10.42	   1.75  4.41  1.75</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +371-721-5240</p>
